{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/56804fd5e618de9eb2effee86beef903.avif?t=1759664737\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/0a0da79bbdc4902149f7d5e941334e14.avif?t=1759664737\" data-has-big width=800 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Valentine \u2013 the cutest chaos queen with enough slay for two!</strong>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a doll museum that offers more horror than anything else. Your goal: face the creepy dolls and find your own way through the dark yet pink museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a game full of cuteness, iconic attitude, and psychological horror!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken as a doll in a kawaii nightmare!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the game, Valentine wakes up in the museum\u2026 as a doll! She has no idea why she\u2019s here, and everything feels both charming and eerie. As her bestie, you accompany her through the first steps and make decisions on her behalf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/2f24eaefa66c164720d5a8bb1c8add02.poster.avif?t=1759664737\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/2f24eaefa66c164720d5a8bb1c8add02.webm?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/2f24eaefa66c164720d5a8bb1c8add02.mp4?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Secrets Behind the Doll\u2019s Smile</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradually, you\u2019ll uncover Valentine\u2019s dark past and childhood traumas. Each exhibit holds secrets that will enchant you while also frightening you. Some dolls play their own nasty games, while others support you in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.poster.avif?t=1759664737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.webm?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/7f011f3ec9381c53623029c8da27accf.mp4?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, run, slay!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll explore beautiful Japanese-inspired rooms full of kawaii details. Interact with dolls, objects, and hidden secrets, and shape Valentine\u2019s fate through dialogues and choices. Avoid dangerous dolls or confront them\u2014the choice is yours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.poster.avif?t=1759664737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.webm?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/ad2d557395aa4cb82ce5f3b2070333a3.mp4?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adorable Skins for every Mood!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize Valentine\u2019s outfits and accessories and discover all the hidden cats in the museum to unlock rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/c93110f0f2e077ba6d5a145f6e2ddbea.avif?t=1759664737\" data-has-big width=1560 height=681 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the Bestie you want to be!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bestie, you decide how to accompany Valentine: a skeleton, a creepy beast, or a cheeky pumpkin head? The fortune teller will reveal your skin\u2019s hands during tarot readings! Who knows, maybe you\u2019ll shine as a sparkling fairy or elegant vampire! Your skin is not just style\u2014it\u2019s part of your personality in the museum, adding more fun, sass, and chaos to the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/64f612d08d17ac0bb2854ad314c51829.avif?t=1759664737\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to shake up the museum?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love cuteness, horror, and psychological depth, you\u2019ll adore the doll museum. Every doll has their own agenda, every room tells a story, and every moment can surprise you\u2014through scares, humor, or emotional depth. Get ready to slay the doll museum in style! Watch out, nothing stays the same!\u00a0<strong>Let\u2019s go, bestie!</strong> \ud83d\udc85</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.poster.avif?t=1759664737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.webm?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.mp4?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive story game with cute, unforgettable characters<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend of psychological horror and cute aesthetics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious, hand-drawn rooms with Japanese-inspired Kawaii Style!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the dolls or take revenge, it\u2019s up to you!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny tarot readings with a sassy fortune teller<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique K-pop-inspired songs that make the game unforgettable<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover Valentine\u2019s trauma bit by bit<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect all hidden cats in the museum<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Valentine\u2019s outfits and accessories to your taste<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic museum: rooms change as you explore<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316150?t=1759664737","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3316150?t=1759664737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/a13d9fce8583d613a4cd33bd4941ae36af4b768b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759664737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/a13d9fce8583d613a4cd33bd4941ae36af4b768b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759664737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Content Warning\r\nThis game contains imagery and themes that may be unsettling for some players, including depictions of blood, disturbing visuals, and unsettling c