h\" >As a bestie, you decide how to accompany Valentine: a skeleton, a creepy beast, or a cheeky pumpkin head? The fortune teller will reveal your skin\u2019s hands during tarot readings! Who knows, maybe you\u2019ll shine as a sparkling fairy or elegant vampire! Your skin is not just style\u2014it\u2019s part of your personality in the museum, adding more fun, sass, and chaos to the adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/64f612d08d17ac0bb2854ad314c51829.avif?t=1759664737\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ready to shake up the museum?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love cuteness, horror, and psychological depth, you\u2019ll adore the doll museum. Every doll has their own agenda, every room tells a story, and every moment can surprise you\u2014through scares, humor, or emotional depth. Get ready to slay the doll museum in style! Watch out, nothing stays the same!\u00a0<strong>Let\u2019s go, bestie!</strong> \ud83d\udc85</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.poster.avif?t=1759664737\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.webm?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/f41f3f083f7ed358f1408825999bdb72.mp4?t=1759664737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 clas