tine\u2019s trauma bit by bit<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect all hidden cats in the museum<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Valentine\u2019s outfits and accessories to your taste<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic museum: rooms change as you explore<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/extras/18f1b9600b2993e3c6becefaf0e52fe7.webp?t=1759664737\" width=19 height=15 /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["delulu girl"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3316150/header.jpg?t=1759664737","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.3 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL-compatible graphics card (minimum OpenGL 4.1)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Ca